<title>UK: Bank Vontobel sets warrants on Adecco SA.</title>
<headline>Bank Vontobel sets warrants on Adecco SA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Vontobel &amp; Co AG said it has issued 1.5 million American-style call warrants, on Adecco SA bearer shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    440 CHF		   PREMIUM	14.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.25 CHF		  GEARING	9.4 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 21.FEB.97-06.FEB.98   PAYDATE	21.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXHANGE	   MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  425 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
